    "Kassettidega BM-21 / BM-27 raketiheitjatest, helikopterite VSM-1 süsteemiga, UMZ-miinilaoturiga või PKM-komplektiga": "In cassettes from BM-21 / BM-27 rocket launchers, by helicopters with the VSM-1 system, by the UMZ minelayer or with the PKM kit",
